  "title": "Mesa Air Group Reports Third Quarter Fiscal 2025 Results and Provides Update on Proposed Merger with Republic Airways Holdings Inc.",
  "summary": "Management to Hold Call Following Market Close Today PHOENIX, Aug. 13, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) - Mesa Air Group, Inc. (NASDAQ: MESA) (“Mesa” or the “Company”) today reported third quarter fiscal 2025 financial and operating results, as well as provided an update on the proposed merger (the “Merger”) with Republic Airways Holdings Inc. (“Republic”). Third Quarter Fiscal 2025 Update: Total operating revenues of $92.8 million Pre-tax income of $20.6 million, net income of $20.9 million, or",
